  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Chapter 650 is titled Return to Hu Immortal Blessed Land. Counting Fixed Immortal Travel lent to Hei Lou Lan and Spring Autumn Cicada, Fang Yuan holds nine Immortal Gu, and his immortal aperture is a dead land that cannot swallow the blessed land.",
      "chapters": [
        650
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land",
        "gu_fixed_immortal_travel",
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "gu_spring_autumn_cicada",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bankruptcy follows the Northern Plains trip once savings are spent, and Zombie Alliance is named as a five-region immortal-zombie force with research into restoring a living body.",
      "chapters": [
        653
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "early-footing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "fac_zombie_alliance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan, Tai Bai Yun Sheng, Hei Lou Lan, and Fairy Li Shan form the Snowy Mountain Alliance at Snowy Mountain under Fairy Li Shan’s beetle Immortal Gu, a rank six information path Gu as famous as sea oath Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        660
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "alliance-sealed-by-an-unbreakable-oath",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng",
        "char_fairy_li_shan",
        "fac_snowy_mountain_alliance",
        "loc_snowy_mountain",
        "gu_sea_oath_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Li Shan holds Mountain Pledge Immortal Gu, and alliances sealed with it cannot be broken.",
      "chapters": [
        664
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "alliance-sealed-by-an-unbreakable-oath",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Immortal Crane Sect attacks Hu Immortal blessed land.",
      "chapters": [
        699
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "immortal-crane-pressure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_immortal_crane_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The conflict settles when the sect acknowledges Hu Immortal blessed land as a subsidiary with no time limit and opens guts Gu trade under Promise Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        705
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "immortal-crane-pressure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_guts_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Central Continent Gu Immortals later cut through the saint regional wall and Northern Plains’ licorice regional wall to enter the plains.",
      "chapters": [
        710
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "immortal-crane-pressure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qin Bai Sheng’s auction draws Northern Plains heroes into Bai Sheng blessed land by crimson reed marsh.",
      "chapters": [
        747
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "northern-plains-auctions",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_bai_sheng",
        "loc_bai_sheng_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In that auction stretch Feng Jiu Ge, under Swordmaster You Lan’s voice, offers the strength path Immortal Gu Pulling Mountain.",
      "chapters": [
        752
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "northern-plains-auctions",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "char_swordmaster_you_lan",
        "gu_pulling_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He later reports Pulling Water the same way, and Fang Yuan obtains both after selling Worldly Wave Trace.",
      "chapters": [
        753
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "northern-plains-auctions",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_pulling_water",
        "gu_worldly_wave_trace"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Eat Strength then appears as a strength and food path cultivation Immortal Gu in the same hall, and Fang Yuan later lists Iron Crown Eagle Strength, Pulling Mountain, Pulling Water, Eat Strength, and Unravel Mystery among his auction gains.",
      "chapters": [
        758
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "northern-plains-auctions",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_eat_strength",
        "gu_unravel_mystery"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heavenly Lord Bai Zu names Unravel Mystery as his wisdom path Immortal Gu that can deduce all traces of any inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        762
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "northern-plains-auctions",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_heavenly_lord_bai_zu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan obtains it when Bai Zu trades it away to break a Red Fiend Divine Boat recipe stalemate.",
      "chapters": [
        763
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "northern-plains-auctions",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_bai_zu_tribe",
        "house_red_fiend_divine_boat"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Seekers then gather at Tai Qiu for Dong Fang Chang Fan’s wisdom path inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        781
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "northern-plains-auctions",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_tai_qiu",
        "inh_dong_fang_wisdom_path_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan kills Dong Fang Chang Fan and captures his soul; the fallen immortal aperture becomes an ownerless blessed land.",
      "chapters": [
        806
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "kill-and-soul-capture",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_dong_fang_chang_fan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 838 is titled Origin of the Refinement Path Convention and stages Fang Yuan inside that Central Continent competition.",
      "chapters": [
        838
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "star-form-holding",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_refinement_path_convention"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan presents Song Zi Xing’s head; Star Form land spirit greets him as master and he enters Star Form blessed land as a second holding placed in Earth Abyss. Star Lord Wan Xiang’s foundation is tied to Starry Sky grotto-heaven, whose owner Seven Star Child sleeps after exploring Star Constellation Immortal Venerable’s dream realm; Fang Yuan placed the blessed land in Earth Abyss after taking Wan Xiang’s body.",
      "chapters": [
        851
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "star-form-holding",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_song_zi_xing",
        "loc_star_form_blessed_land",
        "reg_earth_earth_abyss",
        "char_star_lord_wan_xiang",
        "loc_starry_sky_grotto_heaven",
        "char_seven_star_child",
        "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 864 is titled Sacred Feather City’s Shocking Change. It opens on the feathermen city in the sky and a battle arena where candidates fight to become the new featherman king. Invaders later breach the green sky and force Sacred Feather City, an Immortal Gu House, onto the defensive.",
      "chapters": [
        864
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "succession-fight-and-invasion",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_sacred_feather_city",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lang Ya land spirit calls Fang Yuan into Lang Ya’s defensive battle.",
      "chapters": [
        872
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lang-ya-defensive-war",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "fac_lang_ya_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heavenly Court speakers state that Long Hair Ancestor was a hairy man, and Lang Ya land spirit reveals the same origin when he shifts form.",
      "chapters": [
        879
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lang-ya-defensive-war",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "char_long_hair_ancestor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When twelve wave cloud confusion formation breaks, the surface shows white sky and white cloud soil; a crack through that cloud soil exposes a boundless ocean and three enormous continents where hairy men rule.",
      "chapters": [
        882
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lang-ya-defensive-war",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After the battle, Fang Yuan receives the rank six all-out effort Gu recipe and the method to relocate a blessed land, which he needs for both Hu Immortal and Star Form.",
      "chapters": [
        887
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lang-ya-defensive-war",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_all_out_effort_gu",
        "char_fairy_bai_hu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The stretch ends at chapter 887, titled Short Break; chapter 888 opens Entering Eastern Sea.",
      "chapters": [
        887
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lang-ya-defensive-war",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_eastern_sea"
      ]
    }
  ],
